"Type a reply: the Reply window, ready for typing" = "輸入回覆：叫出回覆視窗，可以直接打字";
"Gemini 3.5 Live Translate, follows the captions (about US$2.2 an hour)" = "Gemini 3.5 Live Translate，跟著字幕翻（約每小時 US$2.2）";
"Google's interpreter model hears the same sound as the recognition chosen above and gives the Chinese for its lines, as the speech goes. Lines it misses, replies and the summary use Gemini 3.5 Flash-Lite. A preview model. Needs a Gemini API key. Not used when recognition is Live Translate itself or record only." = "Google 的口譯模型跟上面選的辨識聽同樣的聲音，邊聽邊給出那些字幕的中文。它漏掉的字幕、回覆和摘要用 Gemini 3.5 Flash-Lite。預覽版。需要 Gemini API 金鑰。辨識選 Live Translate 本身或只錄音時不會用到。";
"Live Translate connection dropped; captions use the text model for now, trying again in %@ s…" = "Live Translate 連線中斷，字幕先用文字模型翻譯，%@ 秒後再試…";
"Live Translate is connected again." = "Live Translate 已重新連上。";
"Live Translate refused the connection (check the Gemini key); captions are translated by the text model." = "Live Translate 拒絕連線（請檢查 Gemini 金鑰），字幕改用文字模型翻譯。";
"Alibaba's small open model running on the Mac: the smallest download (about 1.4 GB) and quick, also does replies and summaries. Its translations are rougher than Gemma's: the meaning is mostly right, with an occasional slip. Set it up below." = "阿里巴巴的小型開放模型，在 Mac 上跑：下載最小（約 1.4 GB）、速度快，也能做回覆和摘要。翻譯比 Gemma 粗糙：意思大多對，偶爾漏字或用詞不準。在下面設定。";
"One click installs what is missing: Ollama from ollama.com (about 230 MB, signature checked) and the chosen model. TranslateGemma only translates captions (replies and the summary then use another model); Gemma 4 and Qwen3 also do replies and summaries, and Qwen3 1.7B is the smallest (the one the original app runs offline). Text never leaves this Mac." = "按一下就裝好缺的東西：從 ollama.com 下載 Ollama（約 230 MB，會檢查簽章）和選好的模型。TranslateGemma 只翻字幕（回覆和摘要改用其他模型）；Gemma 4 和 Qwen3 也能做回覆和摘要，Qwen3 1.7B 最小（就是原版 app 離線用的那個）。文字不會離開這台 Mac。";
"Qwen3 1.7B (local Ollama, free, smallest)" = "Qwen3 1.7B（本機 Ollama，免費，最小）";
"Qwen3 1.7B: smallest and quickest, about 1.4 GB, rougher wording" = "Qwen3 1.7B：最小最快，約 1.4 GB，用詞較粗糙";
"The local model is not set up yet: Settings → Listen & Translate → Local model on this Mac → Set Up." = "本機模型還沒設定好：設定 →「聽與翻」→「在這台 Mac 上跑的本機模型（免費、不連網）」→「設定」。";
"Each session gets a folder with transcript.md and summary.md, and for each segment its own transcript (01-name.md) and, if chosen, its own recording (01-name.mp4 or .wav). Other people's voices are kept: check that everyone agrees." = "每次聆聽會有一個資料夾，裡面是 transcript.md 和 summary.md，每個段落還有自己的逐字稿（01-名稱.md），有選的話也有自己的錄音（01-名稱.mp4 或 .wav）。這會留下別人的聲音，請先確認大家都同意。";
"MP4 (AAC, about 30 MB an hour, plays almost anywhere)" = "MP4（AAC，一小時約 30 MB，幾乎哪裡都能播）";
"Recording format" = "錄音格式";
"The recording could not be written: %@" = "錄音無法寫入：%@";
"WAV (uncompressed, about 115 MB an hour, plays on anything)" = "WAV（未壓縮，一小時約 115 MB，什麼都能播）";
